<title>JAPAN: BOJ injects 200 bln yen into market--traders.</title>
<headline>BOJ injects 200 bln yen into market--traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) injected a net 200 billion yen into the money market on Tuesday, money traders said.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8806</p>
